{
  "bodyHash": "674da26c6a815c2f",
  "content": "\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-family:&amp;#x27\">\n\n<p><img width=\"836\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=836,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/banner-slim.jpg\" alt=\"截圖\"></p>\n\n<p>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmersive-armors\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Modrinth\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=000000&color=00AF5C\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-armors\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"CurseForge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=000000&color=F16436\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/agxcvAdj2a\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=000000&color=5865F2\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveArmors\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Github\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Github-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&color=181717\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fimmersive-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img alt=\"Translate via Crowdin\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Crowdin-NA?style=for-the-badge&logo=crowdin&color=2E3340\">\n</a>\n</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"divider\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<p>\n《沉浸護甲》為遊戲增添了許多符合原版風格且獨一無二的護甲套裝。與枯燥的複製貼上護甲不同，《沉浸護甲》著重於視覺升級的護甲，部分還附有披風或自訂模型。大多數護甲都提供獨家效果，如狂暴模式、反彈、尖刺、神聖防護等。製作配方已正確登錄於原版配方書中。附魔、修復與染色功能皆如預期運作。\n</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"divider\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<p>40 種全新護甲，持續更新中！</p>\n<p>\n\n\n\n</p><p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/atlas?minecraft_version=1.20.1&locations=_immersive_armors:armor&dependencies=https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveArmors/tree/1.20.1&resolution=48&background=fancy&row_size=8\" alt=\"生成的材質圖\"></p>\n\n<h1>木製護甲</h1>\n<p>雖不曉得你的感受，但我實在受夠了被骷髏遠距離狙擊了。這套原始卻實用的護甲能提供相當優秀的弓箭與爆炸防護。</p>\n<img width=\"450\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=450,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/wood.jpg\" alt=\"截圖\">\n\n<p><img alt=\"divider\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>骷髏護甲</h1>\n<p>曾經想過把敵人變成護甲嗎？大概不會吧，但這裡有一套輕量級的骷髏護甲。它能讓你移動得更快，甚至具備凋零護甲的效果。骷髏將不再攻擊你，反而會對任何試圖接觸你的人造成傷害！</p>\n<img width=\"600\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=600,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/skeleton.jpg\" alt=\"截圖\">\n\n<p><img alt=\"divider\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>神聖護甲</h1>\n<p>想要引人注目嗎？來吧，這是一套華麗的金紅配色護甲。隨你喜好為布料上色。除了外觀漂亮且擁有極高的防護力外，全套神聖護甲每分鐘還能完全抵擋一次攻擊！</p>\n<img width=\"500\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=500,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/divine.jpg\" alt=\"截圖\">\n\n<p><img alt=\"divider\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>重型護甲</h1>\n<p>高護甲值、增加護甲韌性並大幅減少擊退，代價是行動力下降。這套護甲專為碾壓最強大的敵人而設計。</p>\n<img width=\"400\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=400,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/heavy.jpg\" alt=\"截圖\">\n\n<p><img alt=\"divider\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>史萊姆護甲</h1>\n<p>好吧，我知道這看起來不太像護甲。但請相信我，它確實有效。攻擊你的敵人會被彈開，爆炸造成的傷害也會大幅降低！不過穿了之後可能會有點臭啦……</p>\n<img width=\"300\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=300,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/slime.jpg\" alt=\"截圖\">\n\n<p><img alt=\"divider\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>戰士護甲</h1>\n<p>這不只是維京護甲，穿上它你就是維京人！每損失一點生命值，斧頭傷害與總體傷害就會更高。進入狂暴模式，在殘酷的近戰中屠殺你的敵人！</p>\n<img width=\"400\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=400,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/warrior.jpg\" alt=\"截圖\">\n\n<p><img alt=\"divider\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>法袍護甲</h1>\n<p>蓬鬆且可染色的羊毛護甲。內置附魔烈焰棒，對所有試圖攻擊你的人造成火焰傷害！對了，它還防火。因為有烈焰棒。科學！</p>\n<img width=\"600\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=600,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/robe.jpg\" alt=\"截圖\">\n\n<p><img alt=\"divider\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>蒸汽龐克護甲</h1>\n<p>旋轉的齒輪、黃銅、羅盤、時鐘，以及大量的煙霧。讓我為你介紹最複雜的護甲套裝——蒸汽龐克護甲。頭盔配備敵意雷達系統，潛行時啟動。胸甲提供增強的 GUI 介面，讓你再也不怕忘記時間！護腿裝備了二段跳功能，靴子則因內建蒸汽噴射器而完全免疫摔落傷害。</p>\n<img width=\"500\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=500,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/steampunk.jpg\" alt=\"截圖\">\n\n<p><img alt=\"divider\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>海晶石護甲</h1>\n<p>利用守卫者的尖刺來取得優勢！這套帶刺護甲會對攻擊者造成尖刺傷害。< 雖然堅硬的岩石會減緩你的速度，但它同時也會提供深海探索者效果。</p>\n<img width=\"450\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=450,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/prismarine.jpg\" alt=\"截圖\">\n\n<p><img alt=\"divider\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<h1>影片評論！</h1>\n<p style=\"display:block;font-size:16px;text-align:center;font-family:&amp;#x27\">\n<span><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/kuGRRFDy7vY?wmode=transparent\" height=\"480\" width=\"836\"></iframe></span></span>\n</p>\n\n<h1>如何合成？</h1>\n<p>\n所有物品均已整合至原版配方書中（亦支援 JEI 等模組）。解鎖配方需要以下素材：骨頭、鐵塊、海晶石碎片、羊毛、史萊姆球、活塞、皮革護甲、法袍、凋靈骷髏頭與木材。\n</p>\n<p>\n\n\n\n</p><p><img src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/mcr/recipes?minecraft_version=1.20.1&locations=immersive_armors:.*&dependencies=https://github.com/Luke100000/ImmersiveArmors/tree/1.20.1&resolution=16&animated=False&row_width=835\" alt=\"生成的配方圖\"></p>\n\n<h1>多語言支援</h1>\n<p>\n《沉浸護甲》已透過機器翻譯提供多種語言，但品質通常不佳。歡迎你透過\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fimmersive-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crowdin</a>\n加入翻譯團隊。\n<br>\n你可以對糟糕的翻譯投反對票，並提交你自己的版本。\n</p>\n\n<h1>不相容模組</h1>\n<p>Epic Fight 模組（護甲將使用難看的預設模型）</p>\n<p>嘗試以低透明度渲染護甲的模組</p>\n\n<h1>模組整合</h1>\n\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hostile-humans\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Hostile Humans&description=Adds Hostile Humans with structures into your world&icon_url=https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/798/586/64/64/638160491085728200.jpeg&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"敵對人類\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<h1>沉浸系列</h1>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-armors\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Armors&description=A lot of unique and vanilla-faithful armor sets.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸護甲\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-aircraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Aircraft&description=A bunch of rustic aircraft to travel, transport, and explore!&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-aircraft/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸航空\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-melodies\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Melodies&description=Play custom melodies on various instruments and annoy your friends!&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-melodies/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸樂韻\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-paintings\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Paintings&description=Drag and drop, pixelate and hang up beautiful art.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-paintings/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸畫廊\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-optimization\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Optimization&description=A lightweight entity-tick-scheduler for doubling your TPS.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-optimization/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸優化\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/selectivebounds\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=SelectiveBounds&description=Hides the ugly block selection outline when not relevant.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/selectivebounds/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"SelectiveBounds\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/man-of-many-planes\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Man of Many Planes&description=A set of additional aircraft for Immersive Aircraft with Create support in mind.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/man-of-many-planes/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"萬機之翼\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-machinery\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Machinery&description=A bunch of rustic machinery to transport, mine, and automate things.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-machinery/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸機械\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-furniture\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Furniture&description=Create custom and fancy furniture in-game or choose from a vast online library.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-furniture/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸傢俱\">\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-gateways\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img width=\"275\" src=\"https://api-rk.conczin.net/embed?title=Immersive Gateways&description=Mysterious, long-forgotten portals scattered across the Overworld.&icon_url=https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-gateways/icon.png&width=275&height=100&background_color=333333\" alt=\"沉浸界門\">\n</a></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"divider\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n<p>不喜歡顏色？部分護甲套裝可染色！</p>\n<img width=\"700\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,w=700,f=jpeg,q=90/https://cdn.conczin.net/immersive-armors/screenshots/dyeable.jpg\" alt=\"截圖\">\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/nostalgia-shader\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n截圖使用的為 Nostalgia 光影\n</a>\n</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"divider\" src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/divider.png\" width=\"250\"></p>\n\n</div>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.conczin.net/common/pixel.png?immersive_pages_hash=4c21d6df030e3633f0c59639a39f2560\" alt=\"頁面雜湊值，便於網頁部署。\"></p>",
